      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need help with a schedule for an opening ceremony for a medical symposium in geneva. it starts at 9am on monday. can u help me map out the morning? i need to include things like when the speakers get there, when we do the av check, and when the catering staff needs to have the coffee/pastries ready. thanks.",
